            <p>The technology has been tested against major facial recognitio=
n models used in law enforcement and private security. By wearing a scarf or =
shirt with these patterns, individuals can theoretically reclaim anonymity in=
 public spaces heavily monitored by AI-powered cameras.</p>
            <p class=3D"trend-summary">While currently a privacy tool, this d=
evelopment highlights the fragility of AI-based biometric security. Financial=
 institutions relying on facial recognition for branch security or mobile ban=
king authentication must be aware of these low-tech methods for bypassing sop=
histicated AI surveillance.</p>
